# Atrax EMP Logic Package
# Author: Kilroy
# Binds to Atrax EMPs
# Will move to the RNG waypoint before switching to factory attack
# Has tremendous range, probably requiring RTS strategies to take down.

ubind @dp-krl-atrax-emp ## Binds to the Quasar-JMP

read currentRNG cell1 42 #Reads current RNG Waypoint
op mul MBX 2 currentRNG
op mul MBY 2 currentRNG
op add MBY MBY 1
read waypointX cell1 MBX
read waypointY cell1 MBY

sensor waypointRun @flag @unit
jump isOut equal waypointRun true #Check if already out of base

ucontrol move waypointX waypointY #Move to random waypoint, then set you're outside.
ucontrol within waypointX waypointY 2 isAtWaypoint
jump isOut equal isAtWaypoint true
end

isOut:

ucontrol flag true

ulocate building factory enemy @copper factX factY isFact fact #find the closest enemy factory
uradar enemy any any distance 1 enemyUnit
sensor enemyX @x enemyUnit
sensor enemyY @y enemyUnit
ucontrol within enemyX enemyY 8 isInPDS
jump PDSShoot equal isInPDS true

ucontrol within factX factY 40 isCloseToFact #If we're close to a turret, then prepare to Boost
jump inRange equal isCloseToFact true
ucontrol targetp fact 0
ucontrol approach factX factY 38
end
inRange:
ucontrol targetp fact 1
end

PDSShoot:
ucontrol targetp enemyUnit 1
